   "en": "Wings with multiple assigned missions will fly exactly one of the selected mission types per mission opportunity. The mission flown will be the first one in priority order, as shown in the left-to-right order of the buttons in the air UI. Mission efficiency bonuses (e.g. from ⟦0⟧) only for that mission type get applied to the wing for that mission.",
